<!--Post: 376--><!--Time: 1088762067-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST376"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Louise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Louise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, July 02, 2004 - 2:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Have you seen the latest on Kansas.com...a man claiming to have discovered the identity of BTK? Incredible, if this is valid -- he tracked him through his IP address and domain name and turned this in to authorities. Read it for yourself. BTK supposedly is a pilot who flies to Wichita on occasion to visit his grandmother, went to ROTC &#40;and is a veterinarian?&#41;. This poster even has a PHOTO of him!!! Let&#39;s hope this is the real thing.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 376-->
<!--Post: 378--><!--Time: 1088870297-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST378"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 03, 2004 - 8:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->louise , Where is the link to see this ? I would like to know where this guy is from,and where he works as a vet,even if it turns out he is not the btk ,I wouldn&#39;t want to take my Dog to him!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 378-->
<!--Post: 379--><!--Time: 1088873579-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST379"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 03, 2004 - 9:52 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well louise, By now I am sure you found out where that rumor started ! It is very sad &#34;that&#34; person needs about as much attention as the btk needs.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 379-->
<!--Post: 380--><!--Time: 1088885029-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST380"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 03, 2004 - 1:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, some poor unfortunates from kansas.com apparently believe Mike Kelleher and I were responsible for the BTK crimes. They&#39;ve supposedly approached the Wichita police and FBI with their theory, too. <BR> <BR>Unfortunately for their theory, I was but 7 years old at the time of the Otero murders and living in Oregon. Also, my parents were quite strict and wouldn&#39;t let me fly cross country to kill families.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 380-->
<!--Post: 384--><!--Time: 1088981128-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST384"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Matt<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Matt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, July 04, 2004 - 3:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Idiots. They have no clue.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 384-->
<!--Post: 388--><!--Time: 1089138822-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST388"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Warren_b<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Warren_b<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 06, 2004 - 11:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->In that whole mess, I was outed as Starfish&#39;s son, a lawyer in Wichita.  It was I who had the photo.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 388-->
<!--Post: 400--><!--Time: 1089300354-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST400"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 08, 2004 - 8:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->At one time, I was sure that BTK was posing as a phone repairman. He would cut the phone lines then tell the woman who answered the door about service being out in the area. With this ruse of being helpful to the victim, he would stick his foot in the door and gain entry. Possible. Has anyone ever heard that maybe BTK was a journalist? Along the lines of thinking that a fireman can start a fire and then become a hero to put it out. A journalist could commit a murder then come to the scene with PD and write about it. <BR>-Deb <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 400-->
<!--Post: 403--><!--Time: 1089323999-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST403"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Matt<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Matt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 08, 2004 - 2:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Flytodeb: Oh yes, have heard some interesting things about the journalist angle.  Glad to send to your e-mail, not in this forum.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 403-->
<!--Post: 423--><!--Time: 1089523621-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST423"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, July 10, 2004 - 10:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok, send it to me at yahoo; I cannot get into my hotmail very often because it is too slow or too busy. Thanks in advance, Matt.  <BR>flytodeb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 423-->
<!--Post: 497--><!--Time: 1089931313-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST497"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 15, 2004 - 3:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m amazed...at kansas.com it says you claimed to have a criminology degree...since when did you claim that Tom? When I&#39;m done with my degree, I&#39;ll mail you a copy and put white-out over my name for ya. &#40; kidding&#41; <BR>Yes Tom, it is most unfortunate that your parents were so strict... <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
